WEBVTT

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.280
Now die!

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:15.910
What? Who the hell are you?

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.370
I'm Inquisitor Mizarisa.

00:00:18.370 --> 00:00:21.880
Ya can't kill my wonderful bed-wetter!

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.960
Wait, it's <i>you</i>?!

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:01.010
Knife vs. Saw

00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.900
I'll protect ya, Hiro.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:11.360
Wh-Why are <i>you </i>here?

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:16.280
That's right! Why is an
inquisitor helping Hiro?

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:19.490
Well, ya know Hiro was
cleared of all charges.

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:23.830
City Guard Captain Tesla
decided so himself.

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:26.880
Tesla holds absolute judicial authority.

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.920
Everyone in town knows that.

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.800
Which means...

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:37.390
If ya insist on harming
Hiro despite Tesla's decision,

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:40.850
you'll wind up facing my judgement!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:44.480
Wow! All right Mizarisa!

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:47.060
This might end the whole confrontation...

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:50.940
Wait, how did you know
I was being attacked here?

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.610
Sorry, Hiro.

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:57.530
The truth is, I was following you
in hopes of interacting with you more.

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:00.450
What? You mean I was being tailed?

00:03:00.450 --> 00:03:01.990
I didn't notice at all!

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:06.420
Never underestimate an inquisitor!

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:10.250
Does she maybe have
a special tracking skill?

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.210
Hiro, I really think you should
let her join your party.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:16.880
Hmm. Maybe I should...

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:19.220
We got off to a rocky start,

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:22.010
but I <i>do </i>seem to have
made a favorable impression...

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:24.390
If she even has a special skill, then...

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.810
I have a great sense of smell.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:30.310
So I just followed the
smell of your pee here!

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.190
Wh-What kind of skill is <i>that</i>?

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:35.030
And is the pee smell really that strong?

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:39.320
I kept quiet to spare your feelings,
but it's a powerful ammonia stench.

00:03:39.320 --> 00:03:41.200
Enough to gag on, actually.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:43.620
You should have said something!

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.790
Not knowing is worse!

00:03:45.790 --> 00:03:48.080
This game prizes realism.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.710
It's not like a comic strip
where things magically reset.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:55.300
The smell of urine won't
just conveniently disappear.

00:03:55.300 --> 00:03:56.550
Oh, I see!

00:03:56.550 --> 00:03:59.260
I'll make sure to change
my pants after this!

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:06.850
Damn. I almost had him.

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.140
Are you crazy?

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.150
Why'd ya just attack Hiro?

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.310
Did ya not hear what I said?

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:14.980
That's right. I <i>didn't </i>hear.

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:17.320
No one told me anything.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:24.620
In other words, I'm just executing the
murderer Hiro and his apparent accomplice.

00:04:24.620 --> 00:04:29.920
I won't learn that Hiro
was cleared until later.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:34.920
You're gonna play dumb and
kill both me <i>and </i>Mizarisa?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:39.430
That's some pretty great crazy.

00:04:39.430 --> 00:04:43.260
Fine. Go on and try it.

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:55.730
As if a little town lassie could
take out a specially trained inquisitor.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:05:00.490
Splatter her brains!

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:05.280
Hey, isn't that overkill?

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:07.580
Huh?

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.830
She's gone!

00:05:09.830 --> 00:05:11.870
Th-That's crazy!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:13.710
Where'd she go?

00:05:13.710 --> 00:05:16.630
There! She's up there!

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:23.550
What kind of childhood friend is she?!
A ninja?! Her physical abilities are unreal!

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:26.970
Kill! Kill! Kill!

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:30.680
I'll slice you both up!

00:05:33.690 --> 00:05:36.190
There! We're safe!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:41.820
N-Now she has two!

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:44.070
And where was she keeping them?!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:50.330
I see I underestimated you.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.290
I'll get serious.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:55.500
I won't let ya kill Hiro.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.210
Mizarisa...

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:59.630
I think I really want her to join!

00:05:59.630 --> 00:06:03.300
The truth is, what I said
earlier was a pretext.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:08.560
I'll tell ya my real reason
for protecting Hiro.

00:06:08.560 --> 00:06:11.140
Your real reason?

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:15.810
The man only truly shines
after ya put the hurt on 'im!

00:06:15.810 --> 00:06:16.690
Huh?

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:17.730
What did you--

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:22.400
I wanna torment him
within an inch of death!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:28.330
I wanna sever his limbs, crush his eyes,
and see him covered in his own filth!

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.580
Oh, what a great accident!

00:06:29.580 --> 00:06:31.950
My spine tingles at the thought!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:33.540
Excuse me?!

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.120
What's this chick saying?!

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.080
She's just as crazy as Alicia!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:42.510
If ya kill Hiro, he'll never
have another accident!

00:06:46.430 --> 00:06:48.220
What's so funny?

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:52.310
You have power, but you're slow.

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:55.600
And with such a worn-out saw,

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:59.860
can you really stop my attacks?

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:07.660
Y-You freak!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:10.700
I'll show you my Chopping Apples

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:13.950
and mince you up!

00:07:19.630 --> 00:07:22.380
C-Crap! She's on the defensive!

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:25.300
I think she's aiming for something.

00:07:25.300 --> 00:07:28.800
She's like a boxer aiming for a counter.

00:07:34.730 --> 00:07:38.020
Your attacks are fast,
but they're simplistic!

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:40.860
With the right timing, I can parry them!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:41.690
Wow!

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:45.490
Mizarisa's training must make
her more proficient in battle!

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:49.320
Now die!

00:07:55.080 --> 00:07:58.580
N-No way!

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.750
You focused your attacks high

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:04.000
to open the middle for a kick?

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:08.010
As a knife wielder? You frea--

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:12.970
Mizarisa!

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:16.140
Don't worry. She's only unconscious.

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:21.020
I'll kill her later. So don't worry.

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.520
But you, Hiro...

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.730
I'm killing you first!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.070
I-It's all over!

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.870
Alicia's too strong and too freaky!

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:35.910
I'm toast! No way can I
beat this childhood friend!

00:08:35.910 --> 00:08:42.170
Fighting won't work. So figure
out how to win without fighting.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:46.710
Fighting won't work... so I need to...

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.050
Hiro.

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:49.430
Hiro.

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:51.140
Hiro!

00:08:51.140 --> 00:08:56.060
Hiro! I'll buy you time to run!

00:08:56.060 --> 00:08:58.850
I just sensed something.

00:08:58.850 --> 00:09:04.400
Hiro, might you have
the protection of a fairy?

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:09.990
Better protect my eyes this time, huh?

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:12.070
H-Hey! That's...

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:17.750
Hiro, just run!
Head for the center of town!

00:09:19.750 --> 00:09:21.670
Hiro?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:30.840
If you were some dude's childhood friend,
what would throw you off the most?

00:09:30.840 --> 00:09:32.630
I got it, Kamui.

00:09:32.630 --> 00:09:40.560
What throws off absolutely any girl,
whether in 2D, 3D, or a full dive RPG.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.520
That's...

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:58.740
There! Take this!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:10:00.700
No!

00:10:00.700 --> 00:10:04.290
Is that what you pictured?

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:06.130
Huh?

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:06.960
Wha-Wha-Wha--?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.880
How stupid can you be?

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.510
At my age?

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:13.930
Like I've never had a guy grab my boobs!

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:16.300
They're oddly realistic about this!

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:21.100
Don't feel triumphant over
a boob squeeze, you virgin asshole!

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:29.690
Oh my. I only kicked you half as hard
as the saw girl. How pathetic.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:34.030
Now, this time it's really the end, Hiro.

00:10:34.030 --> 00:10:36.200
Hiro, run!

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.240
I-I can't move!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.950
Why?

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.000
Was the kick that strong?

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:50.590
Hiro. Join me on the other side!

00:10:50.590 --> 00:10:52.840
And Martin Time is in progress, too!

00:10:52.840 --> 00:10:53.970
I feel it!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.680
I feel my brother's presence!

00:10:56.680 --> 00:11:01.390
Brother! I'm avenging you
and killing Hiro!

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.310
Kill him, Alicia!

00:11:03.310 --> 00:11:05.480
Kill Hiro!

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:08.900
Okay, game over. Checkmate.
I'm completely done for!

00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:11.320
Hiro, don't give up!

00:11:11.320 --> 00:11:13.280
"Auberdine Walkthrough" my ass!

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:14.740
Stupid damned site!

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:18.160
I thought as hard as I could!

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:22.410
Wait. Hold on.
Is that really what he said?

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:25.960
"If you were the childhood friend,"

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:29.840
He meant what Alicia
specifically would hate?

00:11:29.840 --> 00:11:32.590
So that would mean... uh... um...

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:34.380
This is the end.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:37.220
Hiro! Die!

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:39.850
I-I love you!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:48.480
Excuse me? What is this crap?

00:11:48.480 --> 00:11:51.730
Alicia! I-I love you!

00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:54.650
I'm telling you it's
too late for this trick--

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:59.660
No! I'm serious!
I mean it! I really love you!

00:11:59.660 --> 00:12:01.700
Wh-What are you...

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.790
I-It's working!

00:12:03.790 --> 00:12:05.250
Good job, Hiro!

00:12:05.250 --> 00:12:10.540
A love confession from the man
you hate enough to kill! That's a doozy!

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.630
Wh-What?

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.760
Hiro's saying he loves me?!

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:18.050
You're lying! Bastard!

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:22.010
I'm not lying! I've loved you
for a long, long time!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:24.010
I love all of you!

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:27.520
I can't live without you!

00:12:27.520 --> 00:12:30.690
Marry me! Be my miso soup!

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:37.240
I wanna have your babies!

00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:38.740
What?

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.570
What's going on?

00:12:40.570 --> 00:12:42.870
You really...

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.580
What's happening?

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.790
All right! Just a little more!

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:53.710
Alicia! Please, let's stop this!
Let's get along like we used to!

00:12:53.710 --> 00:12:55.170
Too late.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.510
Huh?

00:12:56.510 --> 00:12:59.510
It's too late! It's too late!
It's too late!

00:12:59.510 --> 00:13:02.510
All of this is too late!

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.850
I love you, too, Hiro!

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:08.520
My brother and I both loved you so much...

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.060
And yet...

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.310
How could you do that?

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:15.820
L-Like I said before,
it was an accident and--

00:13:15.820 --> 00:13:17.440
You keep saying that!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.570
You say it wasn't on purpose!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:25.410
But that tragedy only happened
because you said you were leaving the city!

00:13:26.660 --> 00:13:28.750
It's all your fault!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:32.250
You ruined our lives, Hiro!

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:34.750
B-But I...

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.760
Someone died! A person died!

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:41.090
What's more, it was my beloved brother!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.180
So...

00:13:42.180 --> 00:13:44.140
So why?

00:13:44.140 --> 00:13:46.510
Why?

00:13:46.510 --> 00:13:49.270
Why did you run away?

00:13:57.650 --> 00:13:58.980
You did it!

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:02.700
Your quick thinking
avoided the death flag!

00:14:02.700 --> 00:14:04.410
I-I...

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.830
Oh? What's wrong?

00:14:06.830 --> 00:14:11.000
I've realized I've been
wrong this whole time.

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:12.790
Hiro...

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:16.670
I just thought of
everything as part of a game.

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:21.260
I don't have any memories
of Alicia or of Martin.

00:14:22.880 --> 00:14:27.350
But to them, and especially to Alicia,

00:14:27.350 --> 00:14:31.520
I'm a close friend they've
known since childhood.

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:34.350
And I killed her brother.

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.980
Then, of all things,

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:37.520
I ran away.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.070
I didn't grieve or try to save him.

00:14:40.070 --> 00:14:43.150
I just got scared and ran.

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:46.870
That was the greatest sin I committed.

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:52.330
I really suck, don't I?

00:14:52.330 --> 00:14:55.420
Now, now. Don't get so serious.

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:58.040
At the end of the day, she's an NPC.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:00.920
Ah, ow.

00:15:00.920 --> 00:15:04.930
I've never met a girl that strong.

00:15:04.930 --> 00:15:06.840
Thanks, Mizarisa.

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:10.060
No, no. I don't need any thanks.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:12.060
Instead...

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:14.600
Could I cut off just a pinky finger?

00:15:14.600 --> 00:15:16.020
Absolutely not.

00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:17.940
I take my thanks back. Leave.

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:20.110
<i>What</i>?!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.370
We'll need to visit a blacksmith.

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.830
More importantly, do you
know of the Kenura tree?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:37.920
What?

00:15:37.920 --> 00:15:39.840
The Kenura tree.

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:45.420
It's just south of here.
A big tree on a small hill.

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.010
Could you wait for a bit?

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:50.470
Hiro, do you...

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.260
...need to pee?

00:15:53.310 --> 00:15:54.770
No.

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:57.690
Just wait here, please.

00:16:14.620 --> 00:16:17.580
Martin, you're here, right?

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:19.290
Come out.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.140
Hiro.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:35.470
Martin. You came.

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:38.560
You're not startled?

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.560
I guess I'm kinda used to it now.

00:16:41.560 --> 00:16:44.320
Are you ready to die?

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.860
I'm afraid not.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:51.410
But I do want to say something.

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:56.580
I wanted to earnestly apologize,
but I have no words.

00:16:56.580 --> 00:16:59.960
What do I even say?

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:01.380
Dammit.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:02.920
Kamui,

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:06.130
I'm a dumb turd, so I don't know!

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:09.130
What would you say right now?

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.350
It was right there
written in the walkthrough!

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:16.770
Think back, dimwit!

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:18.390
I see.

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:22.150
It was so curt I didn't
really take the words in.

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:25.440
But you were actually giving me advice.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:32.030
You don't have to forgive me.

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.320
But...

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.410
...please come with me.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:44.540
Martin, let's go together.

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:02.520
Brother, help! Hiro won't stop chasing me!

00:18:02.520 --> 00:18:06.360
Hey, Hiro, don't tease Alicia so much.

00:18:09.400 --> 00:18:10.940
I's sorry.

00:18:10.940 --> 00:18:14.870
I done got carried away, I did.

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:19.750
Hang on! Why am I the only one
who sounds like a big doofus?

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:22.830
Brother! Actually scold Hiro!

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:26.750
Let it go, Alicia.
He's sorry. Right, Hiro?

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:29.760
I's deeply sorry, deeper than the see.

00:18:29.760 --> 00:18:34.220
Hmph! You always go soft on Hiro.

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:37.640
Well, Hiro and I are friends.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:40.390
Nope. We's more than friends!

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:43.020
Me and you be best friends!

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:46.360
You're right. We <i>are </i>best friends.

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:50.440
Yup, yup! We's friends forever!

00:18:50.440 --> 00:18:52.900
Hiro, you and I are...

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:56.780
Yeah! Me and you be...

00:19:24.440 --> 00:19:27.190
You and I...

00:19:27.190 --> 00:19:30.400
We's best friends forever.

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:36.490
That's right, Hiro.
Those are the words of our promise.

00:19:39.580 --> 00:19:43.370
H-Hold on! You're disappearing?

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.580
Yeah.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:48.830
You can't! I said I'm taking you with me!

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:51.800
I heard you loud and clear.

00:19:51.800 --> 00:19:55.260
Then come with me!

00:19:55.260 --> 00:19:58.640
Martin Time is over now.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:04.140
Hiro. Thanks, man.

00:20:21.660 --> 00:20:23.290
Hiro.

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:24.410
Reona.

00:20:24.410 --> 00:20:26.080
You were watching?

00:20:26.080 --> 00:20:28.080
Yes. Sorry.

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.710
I see.

00:20:29.710 --> 00:20:31.500
No, it's fine.

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.460
It's okay.

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:38.180
But Martin...

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:40.340
Martin is...

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.850
I <i>was </i>watching the whole time, but...

00:20:42.850 --> 00:20:45.100
I can't see Martin,

00:20:45.100 --> 00:20:47.180
or hear him either.

00:20:47.180 --> 00:20:48.310
So...

00:20:48.310 --> 00:20:52.400
You looked like a creepy weirdo
muttering to himself in the park!

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:55.150
Hey! What the hell?

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:56.820
More importantly, look!

00:20:56.820 --> 00:20:57.740
It's glowing!

00:20:57.740 --> 00:21:01.870
"More importantly?!" You--

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:07.500
"Best Best Friend Killer:
The Best Amicide"?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.250
H-Huh? What the hell does that mean?

00:21:10.250 --> 00:21:12.290
Don't look so down!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:16.920
You got a lovely title, and you're
free of Martin's haunting, right?

00:21:16.920 --> 00:21:19.380
Be happier!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:22.470
Yeah, but there's still Alicia...

00:21:22.470 --> 00:21:28.560
You can clear that up next time.
You can do it now, Hiro.

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:30.600
You think so?

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.770
Yes!

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:35.190
So let's take the rusty
sword to the blacksmith.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:38.190
And let's buy you fresher-smelling pants.

00:21:38.190 --> 00:21:41.160
Ah! I'd forgotten!

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.200
Oh, Hiro.

00:21:46.790 --> 00:21:50.750
Are those church bells?

00:21:50.750 --> 00:21:52.960
What's happening?

00:22:01.300 --> 00:22:04.140
Wh-What's going on here?

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:06.050
I-I don't know.

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:09.980
I've never seen an event like this.

00:22:09.980 --> 00:22:14.350
The city of Ted is on fire?!

00:23:45.740 --> 00:23:49.830
Episode 7: Chance of Survival 0.1%.
